Style "NetSites" NoTitle, NoHandles, Sticky, WindowListSkip
Style "NetSites" BorderWidth 3, CirculateSkip, Color black/lightgray
Style "NetSites" Icon toolbox.xpm
Style "tkgoodstuff" NoTitle, NoHandles, Sticky, WindowListSkip, StaysOnTop
